title: The Empty Seats
subtitle: The delegates who are in prison cannot vote.
view-if: congress_jena = 1 and congress_closing = 0 and e21_cg_halle_out = 0 and march_action != 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.e21_cg_halle_out = 1;
Q.e21_cg_halle_name = RG.dname('halle');
Q.e21_cg_halle_ours = (Q.district_halle_faction == Q.congress_backing) ? 1 : 0;
Q.sys_outcome = 0;
!}
frequency: 300
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: congress

= The Empty Seats

Halle-Merseburg sent the strongest delegation of any district to the unification congress in December. At Jena its benches are half empty. [? if march_action = 1 : Its best men are in Lichtenburg and the other prisons of the province, or underground, or dead in the Mansfeld villages. ?][? if march_action = 2 : Its best men are still guarding the works at Leuna, and will not leave them for a congress. ?] The district has sent their wives and their deputies, and asks the congress to let them vote.

[? if e21_cg_halle_ours = 1 : Halle follows our current. Its missing votes are ours. ?][? if e21_cg_halle_ours = 0 : Halle follows the [+ district_halle_faction_name +]. Its missing votes would go against us. ?]

- @seat: Seat the substitutes by acclamation.
- @strict: Insist on the rules: no mandate, no vote.
- @collection: Take a collection for the prisoners' families.

@seat
subtitle: The hall honours Mansfeld and Leuna. Their votes count, whichever way they go.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.e21_cg_halle_ours == 1) {
    RG.congress.convert('halle', 0.25);
    RG.congress.tally();
} else {
    RG.congress.swayTo(Q.district_halle_faction, 0.02);
}
RG.district('halle', {loyalty: 6});
Q.unity += 2;
Q.lean_offensive += 1;
!}

The congress rises for the prisoners of March and seats their substitutes without a vote. The Halle benches fill up. [? if e21_cg_halle_ours = 1 : They vote with us. ?][? if e21_cg_halle_ours = 0 : They will not vote with us, and the whole hall knows it. ?]

@strict
subtitle: The mandate commission keeps the substitutes out. [? if e21_cg_halle_ours = 0 : A rival loses votes. ?] Halle will never forgive it.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.e21_cg_halle_ours == 0) {
    Q.congress_last_moved = RG.congress.annul('halle', Q.district_halle_faction, 0.3);
} else {
    Q.congress_last_moved = RG.congress.annul('halle', Q.congress_backing, 0.3);
}
RG.district('halle', {loyalty: -12});
RG.congress.bitter(4);
Q.offensive_satisfaction -= 4;
!}

The mandate commission rules that a prisoner's wife is not a delegate. [+ congress_last_moved +] mandates from Halle-Merseburg are struck off. The district's substitutes walk out of the hall, and some of them do not come back for the rest of the year.

@collection
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. Nobody's vote changes, and everybody remembers who thought of it.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The party treasury is empty.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
RG.congress.sway(0.03);
RG.district('halle', {loyalty: 8});
Q.unity += 3;
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
!}

The hats go round the hall twice. The money goes to Red Aid in Halle the same night. [? if congress_last_moved > 0 : [+ congress_last_moved +] delegates are moved enough to come over. ?]
